HELDHEADER|step=12-shadow-cats-2026-07|date=2026-10-19|rule=OWNER-RULES HOLD (other people's private data; files over 50 MB; third-party data) + OWNER-RULES 7.j|note=Blob ids recorded only; nothing in these rows is vendored. The HOLD decisions were re-checked against the bytes of all 205 vendored files (the first 171, and the 34 USIM files added on 2026-10-19: the standalone laws 42-60, the three remaining de1d950 files and test_rime_tool.py). A scan for gh_/ghp_/github_pat_/sk-/AKIA/AIza/hf_/xox/glpat-/Bearer/JWT/ssh keys/BEGIN .*PRIVATE KEY/password=/api_key/secret=/"token":, emails, phone numbers, IP addresses and whatsapp found no credential, no phone number and no whatsapp or other messaging string. The hits are: the three BEGIN ... PRIVATE KEY strings, github_pat_ and AKIA in viewer/github3d.rs (both blobs, 105e7db9 and 92f82521), which form the SECRET_NEEDLES deny-list the viewer uses to refuse key files; AKIA in the NAMED row of receipts/FABLE5-GITHUB-3D-VIEW-V4B-HELD-LISTED-2026-10-09.hbp ("AKIA needle broad, false positives possible"); github_pat_, sk-, AKIA, AIza and api_key in SAFE-ASI tools/verify_repo.py (both blobs, 8c6dba39 and a80b2463), which are the regular expressions of its secret detector; sk- inside the words task- and ask- (both Combined Books, POOL-GROWN-ADDRESS.hbp); gh_ inside through_ in two LIRIS receipts (k=2_through_12, dimensions=3_through_64, THROUGH_MATTER). The 34 added files add no hit. catalog/PUBLIC-KEYS-CODES-KNOWLEDGE.md holds no key material: its "operator keys" are vocabulary tokens (IS, WAS, WILL, COLOR_KEY(k)) and its "public hash keys" are two sha256 digests of public files, two schema names and the repository name. The only email is the owner's own (CHAIN-TOPOLOGY.md line 498, his correspondence line). The only IP addresses are 127.0.0.1 and 0.0.0.0. Local paths (C:/Users/acer, D:/, /root/) are allowed. No rule-7.j component (MASK_GLYPHS, the vote_quorum daemon, the 47D reverse-gain, the reverse-gain seat registration) is in the set; both Combined Books name reverse-gain GNNs only as a concept (law text and operator quotes such as "reverse gain GNNs"), and cite one law whose gate is gate=vote-quorum (Foundation V3 LAW V39); neither is the held daemon, the 47D reverse-gain or a seat registration. Kept and flagged in the README, not held: the Combined Book's operator-voice quotes (personal remarks about his wife and children, a quote addressed to Rayssa) and, in the last version, a first-name membership list; and LAW 71 sealed (24e5e883) lines 48-49, which quote one message from Amy and link the held photograph. Of the 34 files added on 2026-10-19, three carry the same kind of personal content, kept and flagged in the README, not held: the law-37-branch LAW 55 (7b894d3f, -variant-2d56a94) names Rayssa as the owner's partner and the operator pair OP-JESSE-PID/OP-RAYSSA-PID (lines 199-207), quotes the owner on his children with Rayssa (line 219), and quotes his account of his wife and his children's photograph and a first name, Bobby (lines 283-288); main's LAW 56 The Rime Is the Relation (659c832a) names Rayssa (line 23); main's LAW 58 The Sixth Day (df59e334) retells the wife and children passage (lines 17-24). The wife and children passage, Rayssa's name and the name Bobby are also in the vendored last Combined Book; the OP-RAYSSA-PID lines and the quote on his children with Rayssa are only in that LAW 55. The LAW 62 photograph (536745c5, vendored) was viewed: a TV screen showing a diagram, with a keyboard, a game controller and shelves below it, and no person; a progressive JFIF with no APP1/EXIF segment. COLOUR3D-RESULTS-2026-10-09.png is a 1728x1728 RGB image with no text chunks.|json=0
